## 🚀 Hadoop & Hive Processing

The analytical queries were executed through Hive using Hadoop MapReduce.

For example, the route analysis required multiple MapReduce stages:

```text
Stage 1 → MapReduce
Stage 2 → MapReduce
Stage 3 → MapReduce
Stage 4 → MapReduce
```

This demonstrates how Hive translates SQL queries into distributed processing jobs executed through Hadoop.

